WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.684 --> 00:00:09.864
On September 29, the President signed Executive Order 14434.

2
00:00:10.164 --> 00:00:14.984
Its title: Inaugurating the Era of Super Intelligence.

3
00:00:15.897 --> 00:00:23.864
Federal agencies now write Super Intelligence, or SI, where they used to write artificial intelligence, or AI.

4
00:00:23.901 --> 00:00:30.824
In letters, websites and reports. Older regulations and historical records stay as they are.

5
00:00:31.324 --> 00:00:38.424
Why? The White House says the new name “conveys the true capabilities of the technologies being developed today.”

6
00:00:38.991 --> 00:00:45.784
Within 60 days, the President's science adviser must propose legal language to define Super Intelligence.

7
00:00:46.164 --> 00:00:53.784
Until then, SI means exactly what AI meant in federal law. Same technology. New name.

8
00:00:54.284 --> 00:01:03.864
Senator Mark Warner saw it differently. The President's response, he said, was “to rename it and tell the companies developing it to regulate themselves.”
